# Template for `.env.local` (gitignored, never commit the real file).
#
# Copy this to `.env.local` in this directory and fill in the secret below:
#   cp .env.local.example .env.local
#
# `dekit.yaml` at the repo root sources `.env.local` before starting
# `wrangler dev`, so this is only needed for local dev against the real
# GitHub OAuth App (as opposed to the mocked e2e flow, which uses the
# committed `.dev.vars`'s fake e2e-test-client-secret).
#
# How to get the value:
#   1. Go to https://github.com/settings/developers ->
#      OAuth Apps -> find the app with Client ID
#      Ov23liFN0gIJmZ2VREGm (this id is also in dekit.yaml and
#      wrangler.toml -- it isn't secret, only the value below is).
#   2. Under "Client secrets", either copy an existing secret you already
#      have saved, or click "Generate a new client secret" (note: doing
#      this invalidates any previous secret, including the one deployed to
#      production via `wrangler secret put SYNCED_SHARE_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET`
#      -- see TODO-synced-share-rust-d1-migration.md).
#   3. Paste it below.
SYNCED_SHARE_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
